    "title": "Wildlife conservationist Maya Higa to speak at UA Nov. 5 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dustin Bartholomew ,\n22 hours ago\nAustin-based conservationist and creator Maya Higa will speak in Fayetteville next week. Higa, founder of nonprofit animal sanctuary and virtual eduction center Alveus Sanctuary best known as a streamer on Twitch, will appear at the Faulkner Performing Arts Center as part of the UA’s Distinguished Lectures Series at 7 p.m. on Thursday, Nov. 5.\nRead full article\n1",
